1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,640
Welcome back to Car Detailing Podcast. I'm
Alex.

2
00:00:03,990 --> 00:00:07,446
And I'm Sam. Today we're talking
modifications.

3
00:00:07,796 --> 00:00:11,828
Not just any mods — Desert Diamond's Car
Modification Shop in Dubai.

4
00:00:12,178 --> 00:00:18,370
Al Quoz Industrial Area 3, 22nd Street.
Their Abu Dhabi studio does it too.

5
00:00:18,719 --> 00:00:22,031
We've got a guest who used them to get a
car ready before handing it back.

6
00:00:22,381 --> 00:00:27,781
A German couple. Precise. Detail-obsessed.
You'll love this.

7
00:00:28,131 --> 00:00:31,347
Later, Omar drops a leather-care tip
you'll actually use.

8
00:00:31,697 --> 00:00:35,033
Plus our Service Duel — when is a mod shop
the right call?

9
00:00:35,383 --> 00:00:39,055
And a giveaway. Free premium wash. Stay
tuned.

10
00:00:39,405 --> 00:00:42,765
Hi, yes — hello from both of us.

11
00:00:43,115 --> 00:00:44,675
Welcome! Names?

12
00:00:45,025 --> 00:00:49,513
Lukas and Anke. We're visiting from
Munich.

13
00:00:49,862 --> 00:00:53,798
Munich! Love it. What brought you to
Desert Diamond?

14
00:00:54,148 --> 00:01:00,628
We leased a BMW X5 here for two years.
Lease ends next month.

15
00:01:00,978 --> 00:01:02,802
Ah, the return inspection.

16
00:01:03,152 --> 00:01:08,000
Exactly. German standards — we wanted it
flawless.

17
00:01:08,350 --> 00:01:10,678
Smart. How did you find them?

18
00:01:11,028 --> 00:01:17,436
Searched 'car modification Dubai' — their
site came up. car-care.center.

19
00:01:17,786 --> 00:01:18,746
Booked online?

20
00:01:19,096 --> 00:01:25,384
Yes. Filled the form, picked a slot.
Confirmation in minutes.

21
00:01:25,733 --> 00:01:26,645
That easy?

22
00:01:26,995 --> 00:01:33,475
Surprisingly. No back-and-forth emails.
Just a calendar invite.

23
00:01:33,825 --> 00:01:36,201
Nice. Talk us through arrival day.

24
00:01:36,551 --> 00:01:44,711
Drove to Al Quoz. Industrial area but the
studio… clean. Spotless.

25
00:01:45,061 --> 00:01:46,405
Reception area?

26
00:01:46,755 --> 00:01:54,651
Modern. Coffee. They greeted us by name.
Felt premium, not a garage.

27
00:01:55,001 --> 00:01:57,617
European-trained specialists — you'd
notice that.

28
00:01:57,967 --> 00:02:05,815
We did. The consultant, he walked the car
with us. Notepad. Photos.

29
00:02:06,164 --> 00:02:07,532
Documented everything?

30
00:02:07,882 --> 00:02:14,722
Every scratch. Curb rash on two rims.
Small dent rear quarter.

31
00:02:15,072 --> 00:02:16,056
And the interior?

32
00:02:16,406 --> 00:02:22,622
Leather seats — driver's bolster worn.
Steering wheel shiny from oils.

33
00:02:22,972 --> 00:02:24,340
What did they propose?

34
00:02:24,690 --> 00:02:31,098
Rim refurbishment. Paintless dent repair.
Leather reconditioning.

35
00:02:31,448 --> 00:02:33,272
All under the modification umbrella?

36
00:02:33,622 --> 00:02:38,422
They call it 'customized upgrades' —
cosmetic restoration counts.

37
00:02:38,771 --> 00:02:40,139
How long did they say?

38
00:02:40,489 --> 00:02:45,649
Two days. Dropped it Monday morning,
picked up Wednesday noon.

39
00:02:45,999 --> 00:02:48,759
Talk us through the process. Step by step.

40
00:02:49,109 --> 00:02:57,197
Day one: rims off. Chemical strip. Powder
coat — anthracite, factory match.

41
00:02:57,547 --> 00:02:59,251
Powder coat, not paint?

42
00:02:59,601 --> 00:03:06,321
Powder coat. More durable. They explained
why. We agreed.

43
00:03:06,671 --> 00:03:07,295
The dent?

44
00:03:07,645 --> 00:03:14,293
Paintless dent repair. No filler.
Technician massaged it from behind.

45
00:03:14,642 --> 00:03:15,938
No repaint needed?

46
00:03:16,288 --> 00:03:22,384
None. Original paint intact. That mattered
for lease return.

47
00:03:22,734 --> 00:03:24,030
Interior day two?

48
00:03:24,380 --> 00:03:30,284
Deep clean first. Then leather — they used
a German brand conditioner.

49
00:03:30,634 --> 00:03:31,498
Which one?

50
00:03:31,848 --> 00:03:38,640
Didn't catch the name. But it's
pH-neutral. Matte finish, not glossy.

51
00:03:38,990 --> 00:03:40,070
Steering wheel too?

52
00:03:40,420 --> 00:03:47,188
Yes. Cleaned, conditioned. Feels new. Not
sticky.

53
00:03:47,537 --> 00:03:48,569
Anything else?

54
00:03:48,919 --> 00:03:53,719
They touched up a few stone chips on the
hood. Color-matched.

55
00:03:54,069 --> 00:03:56,349
Pick-up day — walk us through the reveal.

56
00:03:56,699 --> 00:04:04,667
We walked in. Car under lights. Rims —
flawless. Dent — gone.

57
00:04:05,017 --> 00:04:05,665
Leather?

58
00:04:06,015 --> 00:04:12,735
Even color. Suppleness back. Smell — clean
leather, not chemical.

59
00:04:13,085 --> 00:04:14,861
Emotionally — how did it feel?

60
00:04:15,211 --> 00:04:22,243
Relief. Honestly. We've returned leases in
Germany, US, UAE.

61
00:04:22,592 --> 00:04:23,888
This was the smoothest?

62
00:04:24,238 --> 00:04:28,846
By far. No anxiety about surprise charges.

63
00:04:29,196 --> 00:04:32,988
Price — 300 AED on the page. Was that it?

64
00:04:33,338 --> 00:04:42,290
Base was 300. Rims and dent added. Still
reasonable. Transparent invoice.

65
00:04:42,640 --> 00:04:43,816
No hidden fees?

66
00:04:44,166 --> 00:04:50,142
Zero. They showed photos at each stage. We
approved.

67
00:04:50,492 --> 00:04:51,740
Communication during?

68
00:04:52,090 --> 00:05:00,250
WhatsApp updates. Photos. 'Rims in oven.'
'Dent 80% done.'

69
00:05:00,599 --> 00:05:02,015
That's next level.

70
00:05:02,365 --> 00:05:05,221
Felt like partners, not a vendor.

71
00:05:05,571 --> 00:05:09,123
Would you go back for actual mods — body
kit, sound deadening?

72
00:05:09,473 --> 00:05:17,201
Absolutely. They do carbon fiber, star
roof, wraps. We saw projects.

73
00:05:17,551 --> 00:05:19,663
Any light mechanical while you were there?

74
00:05:20,013 --> 00:05:25,173
They offered brake check. We declined —
dealer handles that.

75
00:05:25,523 --> 00:05:28,235
Fair. Driving away — the feeling?

76
00:05:28,585 --> 00:05:32,761
Pride. The car looked better than when we
collected it.

77
00:05:33,110 --> 00:05:34,238
That's the dream.

78
00:05:34,588 --> 00:05:41,308
Lease inspector came yesterday. Zero
remarks. Full deposit back.

79
00:05:41,658 --> 00:05:43,890
There it is. Worth every dirham.

80
00:05:44,240 --> 00:05:45,968
Every single one.

81
00:05:46,318 --> 00:05:49,822
Omar here. Quick tip — leather and
interior.

82
00:05:50,172 --> 00:05:50,892
Go for it.

83
00:05:51,242 --> 00:05:56,930
Clean before you condition. Always. Dirt
plus conditioner equals grit paste.

84
00:05:57,280 --> 00:06:01,120
So vacuum, then dedicated leather cleaner,
then conditioner.

85
00:06:01,469 --> 00:06:07,709
Exactly. pH-neutral cleaner. Microfiber.
Work in small sections.

86
00:06:08,059 --> 00:06:08,827
How often?

87
00:06:09,177 --> 00:06:13,305
Every three months in this climate. Sun
dries leather fast.

88
00:06:13,655 --> 00:06:14,831
Steering wheel too?

89
00:06:15,181 --> 00:06:18,925
Especially steering wheel. Oils break down
the finish.

90
00:06:19,275 --> 00:06:21,723
Solid tip. Thanks, Omar.

91
00:06:22,073 --> 00:06:23,009
Anytime.

92
00:06:23,359 --> 00:06:24,607
Service Duel time.

93
00:06:24,956 --> 00:06:28,028
Car Modification Shop versus… what?

94
00:06:28,378 --> 00:06:32,938
Versus a wrap shop. Versus a body shop.
Versus DIY.

95
00:06:33,288 --> 00:06:36,000
Round one: you need a color change fast.

96
00:06:36,350 --> 00:06:39,302
Wrap shop. One day. Removable.

97
00:06:39,652 --> 00:06:42,316
Round two: cracked bumper, structural.

98
00:06:42,666 --> 00:06:44,970
Body shop. Insurance job.

99
00:06:45,320 --> 00:06:48,656
Round three: lease return, cosmetic
perfection.

100
00:06:49,006 --> 00:06:54,526
Modification shop. They do paintless,
rims, leather, chips — one roof.

101
00:06:54,875 --> 00:06:57,131
Round four: you want a star roof.

102
00:06:57,481 --> 00:07:00,265
Desert Diamond does star roofs. That's
them.

103
00:07:00,615 --> 00:07:03,711
Round five: you're handy, want to save
cash.

104
00:07:04,061 --> 00:07:09,317
DIY ceramic? Maybe. DIY paintless dent?
Please don't.

105
00:07:09,667 --> 00:07:13,603
Winner: Modification Shop for the
'everything cosmetic' scenario.

106
00:07:13,953 --> 00:07:17,265
Agreed. One stop. European standards.

107
00:07:17,615 --> 00:07:18,599
Giveaway alert.

108
00:07:18,949 --> 00:07:21,421
Desert Diamond is running a giveaway right
now.

109
00:07:21,770 --> 00:07:24,938
Prize: a free premium car wash at either
studio.

110
00:07:25,288 --> 00:07:29,104
To enter: subscribe to this channel and
comment with your car model.

111
00:07:29,454 --> 00:07:32,406
Easy. Free. No purchase needed.

112
00:07:32,756 --> 00:07:36,956
Winner announced in a future episode and
on Desert Diamond's social channels.

113
00:07:37,306 --> 00:07:38,938
Go drop your car in the comments.

114
00:07:39,288 --> 00:07:42,528
That's our show. Lukas, Anke — thank you.

115
00:07:42,878 --> 00:07:45,974
Thank you. Safe drives.

116
00:07:46,324 --> 00:07:48,364
Omar — always a pleasure.

117
00:07:48,713 --> 00:07:49,697
Likewise.

118
00:07:50,047 --> 00:07:57,655
If your car needs mods, restoration, or
just a proper detail — book at

119
00:07:58,005 --> 00:07:59,805
Car Detailing Podcast out.

120
00:08:00,155 --> 00:08:01,187
See you next time.
